# Plerion Provider

Use the Plerion provider to manage [Plerion](https://www.plerion.com) resources through the Plerion customer API.

This release manages custom checks. A custom check is a rego policy that Plerion evaluates against the assets it collects from your cloud integrations. Keeping checks in Terraform lets you review policy changes in pull requests, preview their findings before they go live, and roll them out through your existing pipeline.

